flowchart LR
  REQ[Agent action request] --> GW[Trust Gateway]
  ID[Identity Service] --> GW
  DEL[Delegation Evaluator] --> GW
  APE[APE - informs only] --> GW
  APSE[APSE - restricts only] --> GW
  AMP[Agent Management Plane] --> GW
  CTX[Request context] --> GW
  GW --> DEC{Policy decision}
  DEC --> ALLOW[ALLOW]
  DEC --> CONFIRM[CONFIRM]
  DEC --> STEP[STEP_UP]
  DEC --> DENY[DENY]
  ALLOW --> AUD[Audit evidence]
  CONFIRM --> AUD
  STEP --> AUD
  DENY --> AUD
  DENY --> FB[Restricted fallback]
  FB --> NEW[New request]
  NEW --> REEVAL[New evaluation]
  AUD -.-> EXEC[Separate executor - not performed]
